# reset-all-keys (M7): Reset all from the keyboard. k dragged to 1.00 and let go (its box keeps the
# focus, no ring); Tab walks on from k's box to b's flip toggle, b's box, h's box and Reset all, the
# last stop of the Transform card (SubCard puts its action last in the DOM): its 3 px ring, --
# foreground on --secondary. Enter resets every value, and as Reset all leaves, a's box takes the
# focus with the keyboard's ring and its keys' tip (TransformRows.tsx). Chromium tabs to buttons as
# the port does (plan call 3 f); WebKit's plain Tab skips them and never reaches Reset all, so this
# is judged against Chromium.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 383 468
wait 16
down
move 433 468 over 160
up
wait 1000
tab
tab
tab
tab
wait 16
shot focused
key Enter
wait 1000
shot reset
